menucolor=7,1
menu Linux for the PC card
menu
menu   1  Linux, text console
menu   2  Linux, framebuffer (800x600, for X)
menu   3  FreeDOS prompt
menu
menudefault=1,3
rem loadlin as the shell: the kernel never returns. Its .PAR files hold the
rem kernel command line.
1?shell=\loadlin.exe @\linux.par
2?shell=\loadlin.exe @\linuxfb.par
3?shell=\command.com /e:512 /p
